## Evidence and dates

The included records are synthetic fixtures. Read the
[manifest](_metadata/evidence_manifest.json) and
[quality results](_metadata/evidence_quality.json), then replace the fixtures
with reviewed observations for your own process. A content quality pass does
not establish the truth of a record.

The pack uses a fixed example base date of 2030-01-30 and scheduling offsets of
two, seven and ten days. `--base-date` overrides the base explicitly. These are
fictional process dates and have no regulatory meaning.

