## Next steps

1. Review the declared flags, questions, selection conditions and stop rule.
2. Confirm the expected scenario and inspect every supplied record.
3. Resolve missing records and export to a fresh destination.
4. Run `ipe seal --export-dir . --no-sign --strict` from the export directory.

Sealing verifies the snapshot; it does not approve the process. Read the
[scope notice](LEGAL_NOTICE.md) before interpreting or sharing this output.
